[22.848872,"o","Fragmentation counts extents in each repo's copy-on-write image, not the files inside it. High values are expected under random-write workloads (databases, container layers) and are informational. Defragmentation is intentionally unsupported here: it would unshare reflinked forks and backup snapshots and inflate datastore usage."]
